                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">各位老师、同学：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">近期，经多方努力，我校将与中国卫星导航定位协会（中位协）、北京大学及下属的北斗办产教融合专家委员会、北大遥感所等联合，创办“北斗元培学苑”及设立以北大资深教授领衔的数学、物理、化学、天文、地理、生物和信息技术七大学科“名师工作室”，同时在新高一建“北斗科技班”，合力探索“科（技）课（程）互长”协同创新机制，与北大等顶级高校携手培养国家战略安全和产业发展迫切需要的“新工科”类高层次科技人才。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体" lang=EN-US>12</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN>日左右，若无疫情影响，<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>位北斗领域院士、中位协领导于贤成（中位协是副部级单位，与郝平校长平级）、北大校长郝平及陈秀万教授、北大数学科学学院李伟固教授、北大物理学院朱守华教授等领导名师大家将莅临我校，参加“北斗元培学苑”授牌及“名师工作室”揭牌仪式（“名师工作室”设在树兰楼三楼原校领导办公室，“北斗元培学苑”牌挂在树兰楼正门及三楼，首个“北斗科技班”设在高二教学楼一楼西侧第一间）。“北斗元培学苑”的创建将会对我校产生深远的影响，既能拓展我校学生进清北的机会，也会为一流高校、重点高中“两高融合”培养拔尖人才提供经验。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">为吸引更多优秀学子来我校，通过“北斗元培学苑”，实现圆梦科技强国、科技兴国理想，圆梦清北愿景，<B>现特向全体师生征集“北斗元培学苑”苑名意义内涵口号。</B>同时，为扩大“北斗元培学苑”的影响力，我们计划在近期让北斗领域<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>多位院士通过视频及题字等形式为“北斗元培学苑”寄语，<B>特向全体师生征集院士寄语内容。</B>其中“北斗元培学苑”苑名口号要着重体现“北斗元培学苑”对于创新国家科技拔尖人才培养、学校发展、学生就读一中的现实意义，要言简意赅，简约而不简单；院士寄语内容要着重体现“北斗元培学苑”设立在一中，以及创建“北斗元培学苑”对于探索国家科技拔尖人才培养的内涵和长远意义。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">请全体师生积极建言、共同参与。教师层面的寄语与口号征集，由教科室通过学科教研组落实到各位老师；学生层面由校团委通过团学联、班级团支部发动学生积极参与。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">征集截止时间<SPAN lang=EN-US>2020</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日中午<SPAN lang=EN-US>13:00,</SPAN>请教科室、团委在<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>5:00</SPAN>前汇总整理出师生的征集内容。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                          </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                          </SPAN>2020</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>18</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">附：“北斗元培学苑”项目简介<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">北斗项目主要按以下三方面内容合作推进：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">一是在我校联合创建“北斗元培学苑”，重点是通过北斗校本课程及青少年科技创新大赛（<SPAN lang=EN-US>BD-CASTIC</SPAN>）、全国中小学信息技术创新与实践大赛（<SPAN lang=EN-US>NOC</SPAN>）等，在绍兴一中培养基础学科、北大新工科招生和“通—导—遥”高端科技三类拔尖人才，为北大等一流高校相关专业招生提供基础性条件。其中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2021</SPAN>年“北斗杯”全国青少年科技创新大赛（<SPAN lang=EN-US>BD-CASTIC</SPAN>）初赛为明年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月，复赛为明年<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月。新工科专业，是相对于<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9F%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/22887894" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>传统工科专业</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>，主要指针对<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%85%B4%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%9A/10813951" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>新兴产业</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>的专业，以<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91/199186" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>互联网</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>和工业智能为核心，包括<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE/1356941" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>大数据</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BA%91%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97/9969353" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>云计算</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD/9180" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>人工智能</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%8C%BA%E5%9D%97%E9%93%BE/13465666" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>区块链</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E7%8E%B0%E5%AE%9E/207123" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>虚拟现实</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/5068669" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>智能科学与技术</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>等相关<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/1594609" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>工科专业</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>，涵盖<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%9E%8B%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/22846767" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>新型工科专业</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E7%94%9F%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/22846787" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>新生工科专业</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%85%B4%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/22846532" target=https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A7%91%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A/_blank><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none" lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>新兴工科专业</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>，目前尚未招生，计划明后年开始，先在已录取北大学生中招生，随后面向应届生招生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">二是邀请北大数学、物理、化学、天文、地理、生物和信息技术学科权威专家，在“北斗元培学苑”创建七大基础学科的“绍兴一中北大名师工作室”，联合我校竞赛、科技团队，对具有科技特长和学科能力突出的超常高中生进行系统化、个性化、专业化“科课”指导，助力提升学校七大基础学科竞赛能力和强基校考能力，同时在学生中开展北大“北斗<SPAN lang=EN-US>+5G</SPAN>”相关国家级课题子课题研究，由名师工作室团队指导完成课题报告和结题，为学生报考北大等一流高校新工科专业提供基础性条件。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-wrap: simple" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体">三是我校设立“北斗科技班”，引进并实施“北斗时空<SPAN lang=EN-US>+</SPAN>人工智能”课程，把我校打造为国家高端技术战略人才和基础学科人才拔尖基地学校。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
    
